digraph account_payable_process_22 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the senior accountant in your department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the senior accountant in your department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_QDMS" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"create a receiving report" -> "OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_QDMS"
		"double check a three-way match" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_QDMS" -> "double check a three-way match"
		"gather the receiving report" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_QDMS" -> "gather the receiving report"
		"report errors to relevant team member" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_QDMS" -> "report errors to relevant team member"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" [shape=box]
		"gather the receiving report" -> "confirm all documents have been amended"
		"gather the vendors invoice" [shape=box]
		"report errors to relevant team member" -> "gather the vendors invoice"
		"OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_QDMS" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"double check a three-way match" -> "OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_QDMS"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" -> "OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_QDMS"
		"gather the vendors invoice" -> "OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_QDMS"
		"schedule the payment" [shape=box]
		"OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_QDMS" -> "schedule the payment"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the senior accountant in your department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"schedule the payment" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following text is about the account payable process. It begins when you send to the senior accountant in your department. 
Once sending to the senior accountant in your department occurs, creating a receiving report needs to be done. 
Once creating a receiving report occurs, one or more of the following paths should be executed: doubling check a three-way match, gathering the receiving report, reporting errors to relevant team member. 
Once gathering the receiving report occurs, you need to confirm all documents have been amended.
When reporting errors to relevant team member is completed, gathering the vendors invoice should be done. 
Then, scheduling the payment needs to be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
}
